    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "breathing doesnt really help when the situation never actually changes. it just feels like i'm waiting for something to break. i'm just so tired of being the one who has to hold everything together. i look at the situation and there's just no end in sight. i honestly just wish i could just sleep and never have to wake up to this again.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
