      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's exhausting to keep holding everything up when the structure itself is crumbling. That feeling of endless waiting is a heavy, suffocating thing, and it makes perfect sense that you just want the noise to stop. If the weight is too much, it's okay to let go of the burden, even if it's just for a moment. Reaching out to a professional can give you tools to manage this crushing pressure.",
      "source": "target",
