      "content": "\"letting go\" doesnt really fix the reality of it though. i still have to wake up and do it all over again tomorrow. it's like a loop that never ends. sometimes i feel like there's no real way out of this feeling, like the only real way to actually stop the exhaustion is to just... not be here anymore. like, wouldn't that just be the most peaceful thing?",
